ind":"announcement","title":"Next Fest - Naughty Nurse Gameplay and Dev Q&A","summary":"Hang out with the dev, ask questions about the game, give feedback on what you'd like to see or what would improve the quality of life. Livestream will feature popogeist, the game's creator and lead developer, and enJen, the game's artist and lore designer, as well as the IRL model for Bertha in promotional materials.The stream will start with some basic introductions, a background of the game's story, then we will then dive in to the story of Bertha. enJen will join for a Q&A. We will then do s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T16:28:43Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687376","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4788070-1846651706687152","game_id":"steam-4788070","kind":"update","title":"Build 0.34.0 - Side Effects And Senses Update","summary":"Side Effects and Senses UpdateChangesEffects:-New effects added -Mirror Mirror: Flips the world as if you stepped inside of a mirror. Controls remain the same, but navigation may be difficult. -Brain Fog: You can't think straight. The timers, counts, and text all look weird and appear to be changing? -Migraine: Light is your enemy. You will naturally want to seek darkness. -New secondary effects added. These have a roll chance after you have healed with a med pack. Some are helpful, some are unf","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T14:54:06Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687152","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4788070-1845383656397002","game_id":"steam-4788070","kind":"announcement","title":"Playtest Ending At Midnight (10/7/2026)","summary":"Just a friendly reminder that the playtest of Naughty Nurse will be ending at midnight tonight (10/7/2026). Players are encouraged to wishlist and download the demo. The build is stable and is ready for Steam's Next Fest October 19-26, 2026. Once the playtest ends, current game keys will stop working.Naughty Nurse will go to Early Access on October 30, 2026.In lieu of playtesting going forward, players with a valid license will have the ability to opt in to the Beta branch if they want to previe","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-06T16:23:04Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656397002","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4788070-1842846814453370","game_id":"steam-4788070","kind":"announcement","title":"Upcoming Timeline Changes","summary":"Naughty Nurse is preparing for Next Fest coming up from October 19-26. Originally, we were planning to end Playtest round 1 and release the game to early access on October 30. We were informed that may not be a great idea due to how Next Fest works. We'd like to quickly go over some timelines instead, and these new dates will take their places:October 7 - Playtest Round 1 Will EndAny downloaded Playtest copies will stop working on this date. Instead, we would like to encourage players to activat","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-07T15:17:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814453370","verified_at":"2026-10-20T17:04:49Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4788070-1839676055898230","game_id":"steam-4788070","kind":"announcement","title":"Naughty Nurse Appearing At Next Fest 2026","summary":"Naughty Nurse has been registered to appear at Steam's Next Fest 2026 fo